@@ -135,3 +135,13 @@ repository; `switcher/patches/host_installd.txt` and the probe fixtures under
 `app-android/core/model/src/test/resources/` list interface facts (method
 names, transaction codes, build properties) read from phones for
 interoperability.
+
+## Raksha Mobile OS integration
+
+Raksha Mobile OS (`raksha17-awakening`, `PackageSets.RAKSHA`) is maintained on
+top of upstream [OneOS](https://github.com/fahadalijaved/OneOS) by **PasanRS**
+(Raksha Mobile OS Project), adding support for the Raksha Mobile OS Android 17
+system image, in-guest `libhwui` fading-edge guards for AOSP/Lineage/Raksha
+guests, single-wizard setup-phase HOME gating, and bundled open-source tools
+including Kali NetHunter, `llama.cpp`, OpenClaw, and
+[Dolphy](https://github.com/unvoiddd/Dolphy-App) (GPL-3.0).
